  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: at the baptism of Jesus, what did the Spirit descend on him like, according to Mark 1:9-11?', 'Mark 1:9-11', 'In those days, Jesus came from Nazareth of Galilee, and was baptized by John in the Jordan. Immediately coming up from the water, he saw the heavens parting and the Spirit descending on him like a dove. A voice came out of the sky, ''You are my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased.''', 'WEB', 2,
   '{"type": "recall", "template": "In those days, Jesus came from Nazareth of Galilee, and was baptized by John in the Jordan. Immediately coming up from the water, he saw the heavens parting and the Spirit descending on him like a ___. A voice came out of the sky, ''You are my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased.''", "answer": "dove"}', true, 2),
  ((select id from w), 'multiple_choice', 'According to Mark 1:12-13, how many days was Jesus tempted by Satan in the wilderness?', 'Mark 1:12-13', 'Immediately the Spirit drove him out into the wilderness. He was there in the wilderness forty days, tempted by Satan. He was with the wild animals; and the angels were serving him.', 'WEB', 1,
