  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: complete the verbatim text of the parables saying in Mark 4:11-12.', 'Mark 4:11-12', 'To you is given the mystery of God''s Kingdom, but to those who are outside, all things are done in parables, that ''seeing they may see and not perceive, and hearing they may hear and not understand, lest perhaps they should turn again, and their sins should be forgiven them.''', 'WEB', 3,
