  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: what did Jesus say to the sea to calm the storm, in Mark 4:39?', 'Mark 4:39', 'He awoke and rebuked the wind, and said to the sea, ''Peace! Be still!'' The wind ceased and there was a great calm.', 'WEB', 1,
