  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: what did Jesus say to the disciples when he walked to them on the water, in Mark 6:50?', 'Mark 6:50', 'But he immediately spoke with them and said to them, ''Cheer up! It is I! Don''t be afraid.''', 'WEB', 1,
