  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: complete the verbatim text of the marriage teaching in Mark 10:6-9.', 'Mark 10:6-9', 'God made them male and female. For this cause a man will leave his father and mother, and will join to his wife, and the two will become one flesh, so that they are no longer two, but one flesh. What therefore God has joined together, let no man separate.', 'WEB', 3,
