  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: according to Mark 10:17-18, what did Jesus ask in response to being called Good Teacher?', 'Mark 10:17-18', '''Good Teacher, what shall I do that I may inherit eternal life?'' Jesus said to him, ''Why do you call me good? No one is good except one—God.''', 'WEB', 2,
