  ((select id from w), 'multiple_choice', 'According to Mark 10:33-34, on which day does Jesus say the Son of Man will rise again?', 'Mark 10:33-34', 'Behold, we are going up to Jerusalem. The Son of Man will be delivered to the chief priests and the scribes. They will condemn him to death, and will deliver him to the Gentiles. They will mock him, spit on him, scourge him, and kill him. On the third day he will rise again.', 'WEB', 2,
