  ((select id from w), 'recall', 'Fill in the missing word: according to Mark 10:52, what did Bartimaeus do immediately after receiving his sight?', 'Mark 10:52', 'Jesus said to him, ''Go your way. Your faith has made you well.'' Immediately he received his sight and followed Jesus on the way.', 'WEB', 1,
